  "releaseNotes": "- Removed unnecessary exception documentation.\n- Updated method documentation files\n- General improvements to formatting and exception throwing logic.\n- Fixed issues with `DuplicatorsEnumerator` state.\n- Fixed enumerator state and adjusted `SplitBy` list initialization.\n- Updated `First` and `Last` methods to correctly throw exceptions.\n- Removed `throw` when dictionary is read-only - The dictionary implementation will throw if necessary instead.",
